  "description": "Foxit PDF SDK for Windows .NET features a powerful, easy-to-use Core API in C# for rendering, viewing, annotation, signing, protecting and managing forms in PDFs. Alongside an extensive industry-leading PDF library for building and automating workflow, Foxit PDF SDK comes with in-depth demos, sample code and a quick start PDF viewer. Start building your own PDF editor tool today.",
